From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Neogram Patchset <patches@neogram.invalid>
Subject: feature/archive-on-pull: open the hidden archive with a pull down

Behind NeoOptions.ARCHIVE_ON_PULL. When a pull reveals the hidden archive row, NeoDialogs.onArchivePulled opens the archive after the stock reveal animation, the same way a tap on the row opens it. Only the chat list with a hidden archive can be pulled (stock hasHiddenArchive excludes the picker, folders and communities).
---
 TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/DialogsActivity.java | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/DialogsActivity.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/DialogsActivity.java
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/DialogsActivity.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/DialogsActivity.java
@@ -2275,6 +2275,7 @@ public class DialogsActivity extends BaseFragment implements NotificationCenter.
                                 if (AndroidUtilities.isAccessibilityScreenReaderEnabled()) {
                                     AndroidUtilities.makeAccessibilityAnnouncement(LocaleController.getString(R.string.AccDescrArchivedChatsShown));
                                 }
+                                ru.llacker.neogram.dialogs.NeoDialogs.onArchivePulled(DialogsActivity.this);
                             }
                         }
 
